{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Divider.png?t=1740860123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Small_Gif_1.gif?t=1740860123\" />\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Small_Gif_2.gif?t=1740860123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Panic in Puzzle World is an action-platformer. The dragon, Tide, jumps, slashes, bounces and blasts to save the 4 Puzzle Masters from their captors, so that Puzzle World can be saved from the robot invasion! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1740860123\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ten densely-packed levels </strong>of<strong>\u00a0</strong>bumping, jumping and fire-blasting, each with novel mechanics to enjoy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rad boss fights!</strong>\u00a0Fearsome robots stand in your way, with tons of attacks to tango with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made a mistake?\u00a0<strong>Rewind at any time</strong>, if you'd like! <i>(this difficulty feature can be toggled on/off</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fun hats, color-palettes, challenge levels </strong>and more to unlock! Gotta use those gems for <i>something</i>, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fun story</strong>\u00a0delivered through in-game cutscenes (which are effortlessly skippable)!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replay any level</strong>\u00a0and aim for S-Ranks and fastest times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Large_Gif_1.gif?t=1740860123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Story.png?t=1740860123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kaboom! </strong>A fierce battle erupts at the foot of Shrine Mountain, and Tide's home is destroyed in the crossfire! He heads to the source of the commotion, encountering mysterious, hostile robots along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Seal.gif?t=1740860123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tide soon meets a rabbit, Violet, who explains that the ancient Puzzle Seal has been broken, allowing the robots to invade Puzzle World.  With her help, Tide sets out on an adventure to rescue the four Puzzle Masters from their robot captors. If the Puzzle Seal can be repaired, there may just be a chance to stop this Panic... <i>in Puzzle World!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Divider.png?t=1740860123\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/654860?t=1740860123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740860123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/c8376ee8dcd0f47caa7b68a713cc4a9d6e43508c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740860123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/c8376ee8dcd0f47caa7b68a713cc4a9d6e43508c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740860123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Divider.png?t=1740860123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Small_Gif_1.gif?t=1740860123\" />\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/Small_Gif_2.gif?t=1740860123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Panic in Puzzle World is an action-platformer. The dragon, Tide, jumps, slashes, bounces and blasts to save the 4 Puzzle Masters from their captors, so that Puzzle World can be saved from the robot invasion! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1740860123\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ten densely-packed levels </strong>of<strong>\u00a0</strong>bumping, jumping and fire-blasting, each with novel mechanics to enjoy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rad boss fights!</strong>\u00a0Fearsome robots stand in your way, with tons of attacks to tango with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made a mistake?\u00a0<strong>Rewind at any time</strong>, if you'd like! <i>(this difficulty feature can be toggled on/off</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fun hats, color-palettes, challenge levels </strong>and more to unlock! Gotta use those gems for <i>something</i>, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fun story</strong>\u00a0delivered through in-game cutscenes (which are effortlessly skippable)!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replay any level</strong>\u00a0and aim for S-Ranks and fastest times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">